                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is essentially a one-button mobile game that somehow found it's way onto PC.  It's the type of game you would expect to be free on some flash site but unfortunetely made its way to steam instead.\n\n- Low replayability\n- The song from the trailer plays over and over again which gets incredibly annoying\n- No real purpose / goals. You get \"Gifts\" each run, and can use them to buy skins for your character, but beyond that there's nothing. (A leaderboard for example would have been a great addition, or perhaps more levels to unlock)\n\nhttps://youtu.be/ZiKnJZnOX_0",
